WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:15.684
and Mandy sat talking in the living room.

2
00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:20.226
The children were nervous about Dad's idea for his den.

3
00:00:20.246 --> 00:00:26.390
"We have to go on as many photo trips as possible," said Mandy urgently.

4
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:31.897
"After the attic becomes Dad's den, we won't be able to go anymore."

5
00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:35.338
"I know," Vinnie said.

6
00:00:35.358 --> 00:00:39.099
"But now Dad is always in the attic.

7
00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:46.781
If only he would leave for a while Loud barking interrupted the children.

8
00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:52.522
"Look who's visiting," said Mom, walking through the front door.

9
00:00:53.703 --> 00:00:55.823
A black dog rushed in after her.

10
00:00:55.843 --> 00:01:00.497
"Corky!" cried Vinnie, rubbing the dog's head.

11
00:01:01.638 --> 00:01:04.680
Corky was the neighbor's dog and very friendly.

12
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:07.662
"I thought I heard Corky's bark!"

13
00:01:08.182 --> 00:01:10.444
said Dad, coming down the stairs.

14
00:01:11.705 --> 00:01:13.366
Corky jumped into his arms.

15
00:01:13.386 --> 00:01:15.607
"Good boy!

16
00:01:15.827 --> 00:01:16.788
Good Corky!"

17
00:01:17.429 --> 00:01:19.590
Dad patted the dog affectionately.

18
00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:24.774
"We've been asked to watch Corky for a few hours," said Mom.

19
00:01:24.794 --> 00:01:28.156
"Our neighbor has a doctor's appointment."

20
00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:35.424
Dad loved dogs and wanted to get one, but Mom always said no.

21
00:01:35.444 --> 00:01:39.507
"I have an idea," Dad said brightly.

22
00:01:39.527 --> 00:01:42.489
"Let's take Corky to the park."

23
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.271
"Sounds good," agreed Vinnie.

24
00:01:46.291 --> 00:01:48.693
"I can take my bike."

25
00:01:50.114 --> 00:01:52.315
Mandy stared hard at her brother.

26
00:01:52.335 --> 00:01:57.158
"Vinnie!" she said through clenched teeth.

27
00:01:57.178 --> 00:02:00.805
"Mandy? Do you want to go too?"

28
00:02:01.425 --> 00:02:02.045
asked Mom.

29
00:02:02.065 --> 00:02:06.748
"Uh, yes," Mandy said slowly.

30
00:02:06.768 --> 00:02:10.810
"But I have to get something from upstairs.

31
00:02:11.991 --> 00:02:12.991
Vinnie does too."

32
00:02:13.011 --> 00:02:14.792
"I do?"

33
00:02:15.393 --> 00:02:16.573
Vinnie looked puzzled.

34
00:02:17.794 --> 00:02:19.855
Then he realized what Mandy meant.

35
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:22.176
"That's right!

36
00:02:23.257 --> 00:02:24.378
We'll be right back."

37
00:02:25.898 --> 00:02:28.280
Vinnie followed Mandy up to the attic.

38
00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:33.614
"Sorry about that," he said, reaching for the album.

39
00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:36.595
"I didn't catch on to your plan."

40
00:02:36.615 --> 00:02:41.317
"We can go on a photo trip," said Mandy.

41
00:02:41.337 --> 00:02:45.099
"And still be back in time to play with Corky."

42
00:02:46.259 --> 00:02:48.940
Vinnie opened the album to the next page.

43
00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.862
"Look at this one, Mandy," he said.

44
00:02:54.463 --> 00:02:57.364
The old man was on a ship at sea.

45
00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:01.045
He stood near a large coil of rope.

46
00:03:02.566 --> 00:03:06.527
Three small round things rested on top of the coil.

47
00:03:06.547 --> 00:03:12.510
"They look like rocks," said Mandy, examining the picture.

48
00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.471
Next to them, a wooden object glowed.

49
00:03:16.491 --> 00:03:19.012
"What could this be?"

50
00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:21.933
"We'll soon find out!"

51
00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:23.094
said Vinnie.

52
00:03:24.314 --> 00:03:28.236
The children's eyes closed, and they fell down the dark tunnel.

53
00:03:32.548 --> 00:03:36.370
The children landed hard, and their fall echoed loudly.

54
00:03:38.191 --> 00:03:42.133
They were in a building with a high ceiling and large windows.

55
00:03:43.494 --> 00:03:46.176
The children lay between some wooden benches.

56
00:03:46.196 --> 00:03:51.298
"I think we're in a church," whispered Vinnie.

57
00:03:52.439 --> 00:03:54.940
He pointed to a large cross on the wall.

58
00:03:55.981 --> 00:03:57.862
There were statues of angels too.

59
00:03:57.882 --> 00:04:01.544
"Look," said Mandy quietly.

60
00:04:02.888 --> 00:04:06.109
She pointed at two men standing together and talking.

61
00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:09.971
One man held a book close to his chest.

62
00:04:09.991 --> 00:04:12.892
"Finally!" the man said.

63
00:04:12.912 --> 00:04:16.994
"The king and queen have provided the money for my journey.

64
00:04:18.274 --> 00:04:22.236
With your powerful family behind me, we'll sail west to the Indies."

65
00:04:23.837 --> 00:04:28.338
"My brothers and I support you fully, Master Columbus," said the other man.

66
00:04:28.359 --> 00:04:31.740
"Columbus?" whispered Vinnie.

67
00:04:32.978 --> 00:04:34.873
"Is he Christopher Columbus?"
